# ColorSamples sets two samples, then a bracketed Color supplies three
# values: the array disagrees with the count the file itself set, not with
# the default.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention." Not third-party.
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
ColorSamples [0.125 0.25 0.375 0.5 0.625 0.75] [0.875 1 1.125 1.25 1.375 1.5]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Color [1 0 0]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
